# Privacy Policy - Nitnem App

## 📋 Overview

This document outlines the privacy practices for the **Nitnem** mobile application.

## 📅 Effective Date
**August 24, 2025**

## 🔒 Privacy Commitment

Nitnem ("we", "our", or "the app") is committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring transparency about our data practices.

## 📊 Data Collection Policy

### What We Do NOT Collect
- ❌ **No personal information** is collected
- ❌ **No usage data** is tracked
- ❌ **No location data** is accessed
- ❌ **No device information** is gathered
- ❌ **No analytics** are implemented

### What We Store Locally
- ✅ **Theme settings** (light/dark mode preferences)
- ✅ **Last scroll position** (to resume where you left off)
- ✅ **App preferences** (user-selected options)

## 🌐 Data Sharing & Transmission

### No External Data Transmission
- 📶 **No data is sent** to our servers
- 🤝 **No data is shared** with third parties
- 🌍 **No internet connection required** for core functionality

### Offline Functionality
- 📱 The app works **fully offline**
- 🔄 All data remains **local to your device**
- 🗄️ No cloud synchronization or backup

## 🔐 Security

Your data remains secure because:
- All stored information remains on your device
- No external APIs or services are called
- No network permissions are required

